WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Oh, boy, thank you.

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,160
You're welcome. What are you doing?

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,280
You can let your child throw it away

4
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,600
Hey, the kids are busy with me and don’t even pay attention.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,880
I can only do it by myself

6
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,640
I'm cleaning up the house today

7
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,960
I have to throw away a lot of messy stuff

8
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:14,300
The messy things need to be thrown away

9
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,220
Grandma, are there many more things?

10
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,780
It’s not easy to throw you away like this

11
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:18,980
Otherwise, I'll throw it away for you.

12
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,300
How can you be so embarrassed?

13
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,580
It's okay. I'm also idle when I'm free.

14
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:25,100
Look, my body is really good at carrying things.

15
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,420
Let me throw it for you

16
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,460
It won't be easy if you just fall down

17
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,740
Yes, grandma, my brother Xiao is amazing.

18
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:33,330
Moving these things is not included in the drawing.

19
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:40,000
Then I'm sorry, are you okay?

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,480
Grandma, do you want to throw away these clothes too?

21
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,440
Yes, they are all old clothes.

22
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,240
I'm going to clean it up and throw it away

23
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,360
can you give it to me

24
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:49,320
I'll help you move everything else down

25
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,800
Can I just have this bag of clothes?

26
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,960
of course

27
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,560
These were meant to be thrown away

28
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:56,000
Grandma, I, Brother Xiao, came from a small mountain village.

29
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,280
He's very poor there

30
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,960
Okay, you can move out

31
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,000
thank you grandma

32
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Peng sleep, please help grandma clean up this garbage.
